---
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<section id="casos-de-exito" class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 scroll-mt-16">
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-16">
    <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#4928C2]/50 bg-[#0B0D12] px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#E3D9FC] uppercase">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#BF40FA]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Casos de Éxito &amp; Proyectos Reales</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-outfit text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#F8F6FF] sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
      Ingeniería comprobable, <span class="text-[#BF40FA]">no promesas vacías</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/90">
      Estos son proyectos reales desarrollados y operados por Juanma Merodio. Podés hacer clic en cualquiera de las capturas para ver cómo abren al instante en vivo.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Primary Showcase: 3 Flagship Real Success Cases -->
  <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3 mb-16">
    {SITE.caseStudies.map((cs) => (
      <article class="group flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#4928C2]/45 bg-[#0B0D12] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#BF40FA]">
        <div>
          <!-- Real 16:9 Hero Capture -->
          <a
            href={cs.url}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label={`Abrir sitio en vivo de ${cs.title}`}
            class="block overflow-hidden border-b border-[#4928C2]/30 bg-[#040607] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#BF40FA]"
          >
            <img
              src={cs.screenshot}
              alt={cs.screenshotAlt}
              width="1440"
              height="900"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="aspect-video w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
            />
          </a>

          <div class="p-6 sm:p-7">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <span class="rounded-full border border-[#4928C2]/50 bg-[#040607] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#E3D9FC]">
                {cs.badge}
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>En Producción</span>
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="mt-4 font-outfit text-2xl font-bold text-[#F8F6FF]">
              {cs.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]">{cs.subtitle}</p>

            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/85">
              {cs.description}
            </p>

            <!-- Flat Metrics Row (no nested cards) -->
            <dl class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-t border-[#4928C2]/25 pt-4 text-center">
              {cs.metrics.map((m) => (
                <div>
                  <dd class="font-outfit text-base font-extrabold text-[#F8F6FF]">{m.value}</dd>
                  <dt class="mt-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-[#E3D9FC]/80">{m.label}</dt>
                </div>
              ))}
            </dl>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Live Link Footer -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#4928C2]/25 bg-[#040607]/60 px-6 py-4 sm:px-7">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E3D9FC]/75">{cs.urlDisplay}</span>
          <a
            href={cs.url}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#E3D9FC] hover:text-[#BF40FA] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#BF40FA] transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Ver sitio en vivo<span class="sr-only"> de {cs.title}</span></span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <!-- Highlight Row: Health Demo Transformation & Speed Benchmark -->
  <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 items-stretch">
    <!-- Star Clinical Showcase: Lic. Sofía Ramos -->
    <article class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border-2 border-[#BF40FA]/80 bg-[#0B0D12]">
      <div>
        <a
          href={SITE.demoLiveUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Abrir muestra en vivo de Lic. Sofía Ramos"
          class="block overflow-hidden border-b border-[#4928C2]/35 bg-[#040607] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#BF40FA]"
        >
          <img
            src={SITE.demoScreenshot}
            alt={SITE.demoScreenshotAlt}
            width="1440"
            height="900"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="aspect-video w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
          />
        </a>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <span class="rounded-full bg-[#BF40FA] px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-extrabold text-[#040607]">
              ★ CASO DE ÉXITO EN SALUD · MUESTRA EN VIVO
            </span>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]">Estilo #01 Editorial Delta</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-5 font-outfit text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#F8F6FF]">
            Lic. Sofía Ramos — Nutrición Funcional &amp; Deportiva
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/90">
            Reemplazó un enlace improvisado en Instagram por una página ordenada con sus reseñas reales de Google Maps, método de atención y turnos directos.
          </p>

          <!-- Flat Before vs After Comparison -->
          <div class="mt-6 grid gap-5 border-t border-[#4928C2]/25 pt-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="border-l-2 border-red-400/70 pl-4">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-red-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Antes de NexoBow</p>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#E3D9FC]/85 leading-relaxed">
                35 mensajes por semana preguntando precios y demasiados turnos que se olvidaban o caían sin aviso.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-400 pl-4">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Con NexoBow Activo</p>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#F8F6FF] leading-relaxed">
                +14 consultorías por semana con pacientes ya informados y listos para confirmar horario.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Live Metrics Strip -->
          <dl class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-[#4928C2]/25 pt-5 text-center">
            <div>
              <dd class="font-outfit text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#F8F6FF]">0.6s</dd>
              <dt class="mt-0.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/80">Apertura en Celular</dt>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dd class="font-outfit text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#BF40FA]">0 esperas</dd>
              <dt class="mt-0.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/80">Sin Cargas Lentas</dt>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dd class="font-outfit text-2xl font-extrabold text-emerald-400">100/100</dd>
              <dt class="mt-0.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/80">Calificación Google</dt>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-[#4928C2]/30 bg-[#040607]/60 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
        <span class="text-sm text-[#E3D9FC]/80">Carga instantánea en celular y computadora</span>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href={SITE.demoLiveUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#BF40FA] bg-[#040607] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-[#F8F6FF] transition-colors hover:bg-[#BF40FA] hover:text-[#040607] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#BF40FA]"
          >
            <span>Ver demo en vivo</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href={SITE.whatsappUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors"
          >
            Pedir web similar →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Speed Comparison Benchmark -->
    <aside class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl border border-[#4928C2]/45 bg-[#0B0D12] p-6 sm:p-8">
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-[#4928C2]/50 bg-[#040607] px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#E3D9FC]">
            Velocidad Real en Celular
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/80">Medición Comparativa</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="mt-5 font-outfit text-2xl font-bold text-[#F8F6FF]">
          Página lenta tradicional vs. Página rápida NexoBow
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/85">
          4 de cada 10 pacientes que tocan un enlace desde Instagram o Google Maps cierran la página si tarda más de 3 segundos en abrir.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 border-t border-[#4928C2]/25 pt-6">
          <!-- WordPress Elementor -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm font-bold text-red-300">
              <span>WordPress / Elementor tradicional</span>
              <span>4.8s de espera</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2.5 h-2.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#1A1D26]">
              <div class="h-full w-[82%] rounded-full bg-red-500"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#E3D9FC]/80">
              Demora en abrir desde datos móviles y el paciente se va antes de ver tu botón de WhatsApp.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- NexoBow -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm font-bold text-[#E3D9FC]">
              <span>Página NexoBow en vivo</span>
              <span class="font-extrabold text-emerald-400">0.6s al instante</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2.5 h-2.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#1A1D26]">
              <div class="h-full w-[14%] rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#E3D9FC]/90">
              Abre de inmediato en cualquier teléfono, sin plugins que se rompan ni demoras.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-[#4928C2]/25 pt-5 text-sm text-[#E3D9FC]/85">
        <span class="font-semibold text-emerald-400">✓ Garantizado: abre en menos de 1 segundo.</span>
        <a
          href={SITE.whatsappUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-bold text-[#E3D9FC] underline decoration-[#BF40FA]/70 underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#BF40FA] transition-colors"
        >
          Consultar por WhatsApp ({SITE.phone}) →
        </a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
